spaceflight.\n\nJoin our community and share your thoughts on Discord:\nhttps://discord.gg/qPGyZYQune", "short_description": "*EARLY ACCESS*\n\nStep into the Rocket Garden museum, a free-to-play VR experience that lets you explore life-size rockets and aerospace artifacts. Discover the wonder of space exploration, accessible to anyone, anywhere.\n\nRocket Garden is currently in Early Access, with new features and exhibits planned for future updates. We welcome your feedback to help shape the experience.\n\nJoin our community and share your thoughts on Discord:\nhttps://discord.gg/qPGyZYQune"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://rocket-garden.com/privacy_policy_rocket_garden.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Timestep Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://rocket-garden.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28771642932470035"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507818746_809337668715208_6974470156784993145_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-CCrggcF8doQ7kNvwHTq9iH&_nc_oc=AdpVB21vQH2hB_bfT2kVS-EVcH3u1GblgshjMZBAIVUdQi8ieO5KPT12Df-WHEYAyCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTjzACYV89wlTyU1t-ou1xNBnanSojPkdcLGBsO-NGH8w&oe